# Runtime logs. `data/catalog.jsonl`, `data/orders.jsonl` and
# `data/preorder-runs.jsonl` are append-only state written by a running system,
# not source. Committing them would put a catalogue in the repository, and the
# suite asserts THIS repository publishes no product — so a stray commit here
# would turn a fixture into a published garment.
